    "title": "Hialeah man faces battery count - NewsBreak",
    "text": "LONG KEY — A 22-year-old Hialeah, Florida man was arrested Saturday, July 26, after allegedly hitting another man several times in the head with a closed first at Fiesta Key. Pedro Rafael Rosa Perez was charged with battery, according to the Monroe County Sheriff's Office. Deputies were called to the 70000 block of the Overseas Highway at approximately 9:30 p.m. regarding a battery. An ongoing argument that reportedly began on a boat earlier in the day resulted in Rosa Perez committing the battery, according to multiple witnesses.",
